{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":6},"Thanatos, l'ultime passage","Ils se sont réveillés à la morgue ou de leur coma et ont été déclarés morts par la médecine. Revenus de l’autre rive, ils témoignent de cette expérience «indéfinissable» tant elle a changé leur vie, quelque soit leur nationalité, leur religion ou philosophie. Première enquête cinématographique sur l’au delà, pendant 2 ans, un journaliste est parti à la rencontre de celles et de ceux qui disent avoir vécu l’expérience de l’au-delà.",[4,5],"self-employment","high rank employment",{"type":7,"id":8,"slug":9,"title":10,"release":12,"filmType":16,"directors":17,"genre":26,"media":29,"synopsis":32,"production":33,"characters":36,"roles":37,"awards":69,"tags":3},"Film","FR2019_177","fr2019-177-thanatos-l-ultime-passage",{"native":1,"english":11},"",{"type":13,"date":14,"year":15},"Theatrical release","2019-10-30",2019,"Documentary",[18],{"id":19,"slug":20,"name":19,"birthYear":21,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":24,"awards":25},"Pierre Barnérias","pierre-barnerias",1965,0,"Male identifying","France",[],[27,28],"Documentary – Expository mode","Documentary – Participatory mode",{"posterUrl":30,"trailerUrl":31},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/123/63/212859/format_page/thanatos-l-ultime-passage.png","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pNtPZXi766c",{"native":2,"english":11},[34],{"country":24,"share":35},"Majority coproducer",[],[38,46,52,56,63],{"person":39,"role":45},{"id":40,"slug":41,"name":40,"birthYear":42,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":43,"awards":44},"Eben Alexander","eben-alexander",1953,"United States of America (the)",[],"Documentary subject",{"person":47,"role":45},{"id":48,"slug":49,"name":48,"birthYear":50,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":24,"awards":51},"Jean-Jacques Charbonier","jean-jacques-charbonier",1956,[],{"person":53,"role":55},{"id":19,"slug":20,"name":19,"birthYear":21,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"national